 Row_number() ---unique ranking,does not handle ties, no gaps in ranking

 Rank()over(partition by productid order by sales) shared rank, handles ties, gaps in ranking
    empty    optional               must
 
dense_rank() --- shared rank, handles ties, no gaps in ranking.
 Ntile()
      should have number 


