ROW_NUMBER()
→ Unique number
→ No ties
→ Deduplication

RANK()
→ Same rank for ties
→ Gaps after ties

DENSE_RANK()
→ Same rank for ties
→ No gaps

CUME_DIST()
→ Cumulative distribution
→ 0 to 1
→ Proportion of rows at/below current value

PERCENT_RANK()
→ Relative rank
→ 0 to 1
→ (rank - 1)/(rows - 1)

NTILE(n)
→ Divide rows into n groups
→ Approximately equal groups


Row_number():

--ranking orders based on therir sales from highest to lowest

select orderid,productid,sales, row_number() over(order by sales)as sales_rank from sales.orders

---rank()---

select orderid,productid,sales, row_number()over(order by sales)as sales_rank,rank() over(order by sales)as sales_rankusing_rank from sales.orders


